@startuml Activity Diagram - Admin Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundCorner 20
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontSize 12
    RoundCorner 15
}
skinparam activityDiamond {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F9A825
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam swimlane {
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BorderColor #BDBDBD
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 13
}

title <size:22><b>Academic Event Management System</b></size>\n<size:16><color:#666666>Activity Diagram — Admin Complete Workflow</color></size>\n
footer <size:10>Prepared for Black Book Submission | Academic Event Management System</size>

|Admin|
start

:Login with **ADMIN** credentials;

:View **Dashboard** overview;
note right
  Dashboard shows:
  • Total Users, Events, Registrations
  • Revenue collected
  • Attendance rate
  • Charts (pie + bar)
end note

:Manage **Events**;

fork
    :**Create New Event**;
    :Fill event form:\n• Title, Description\n• Date, Time, Deadline\n• Max Participants\n• Fee (if paid)\n• Category, Venue\n• Coordinator details;
    :Upload **Banner Image**\n(max 10MB, image only);
    :Event saved with status = "Upcoming";
    :Notification sent to ALL users;
fork again
    :**Edit Existing Event**;
    :Update event details;
fork again
    :**Delete Event**\n(cascade: Quiz, Gallery,\nFeedback, Certificate,\nAttendance, Payment,\nRegistration);
end fork

:View **Participants** for event;

fork
    :**Approve Registration**;
    :Notification + Email to student;
fork again
    :**Reject Registration**;
    :Notification + Email to student;
end fork

:Mark **Attendance**\n(Present / Absent);

if (Student Present + Approved?) then (Yes)
    :Generate **Certificate**;
    :PDF with:\n• Category background\n• College logo\n• Student name\n• Event name\n• Signature;
    :Notification + Email to student;
else (No)
endif

:Manage **Quizzes**;

fork
    :**Create Quiz**;
    :Set title, total marks,\npassing marks;
fork again
    :**Add MCQ Questions**;
    :4 options + correct answer\n+ marks per question;
end fork

:**Publish Quiz Results**\nwhen students complete;

:Manage **Feedback**;
:View ratings and comments;

:View **Reports**;

fork
    :View Registration Report;
fork again
    :View Attendance Report;
fork again
    :View Payment Report;
fork again
    :View Certificate Report;
fork again
    :View Feedback Report;
end fork

fork
    :**Export as CSV**;
fork again
    :**Export as PDF**;
end fork

:Send **Bulk Notifications**\nto all users;

stop

@enduml
